<title>USA: Airways November load factor falls.</title>
<headline>Airways November load factor falls.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AirWays Corp said on Monday its load factor for November fell to 55.8 percent from 59.7 percent in November 1995.</p>
<p>In the year-to-date period, AirWays Corp's load factor increased to 65.4 percent for the 11 month period from 57.7 percent in the comparable year ago period.</p>
</text>
